              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilenchanïn ECHOTYON, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tomönye so lïmanyi pich kïlentöy, ‘Kiyon ECHOTYON Israel nko Yuda, pich odeny cho kikïlchï kegh nyinte?’ Nka nyï ye kasas chane piköchan ntömökuyitönye lö pich. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kamwaghan ante ECHOTYON lö, kïle otini kyaman muma lö mï ato lïku pöghet nko ato lïku oghö, asatan wölo töptoy tïkwïn ompö yïm nko ngwïny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kïmopïstenanye kokay okonyït muma nyo kyaman nko monïngo Yakopo nko mötworintenyan Daudi nyo kyamaghan lö okïlan chi nyo pö ara Daudi kïpayta monïngo Apraam nko Isak nko Yakopo. Osyonchinan chane, asoyön kïnyorï mökosyengwa ngat.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
